        instruction = "Once in Attohwa Chasm, travel to the eastern half of the map towards Parradamo Tor mountain. Then, Travel up and around the North side of Parradamo Tor heading Eastward. Make your way to the middle of the intersection of Attohwa Chasm L-8 & Attohwa Chasm K-8.",
