        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 45,
        marker = "***",
        depth = 3,
        instruction = "Using a mount can be a quick way to break the jewel in case you fell down the mountain and want to reobtain it in order to reset the timer.",
        action = "note",
        entities = {  },
        zones = {  },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = {  },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 46,
        marker = "*",
        depth = 1,
        instruction = "Next, you'll need to climb the intricate mountain Parradamo Tor. From obtaining your Mimeo Jewel, you will have thirty minutes (Earth time) to reach the \"Cradle of Rebirth\" target on the Tor's summit before the Mimeo Jewel breaks.",
        action = "note",
        entities = { "Parradamo Tor", "Mimeo Jewel" },
        zones = {  },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = {  },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 47,
        marker = "*",
        depth = 1,
        instruction = "You will be warned at various intervals of the Mimeo Jewel's status. If you can't get to the top in time (you will receive a message that the Jewel has \"grown completely dark and shattered\"), you'll have to return to the Loose Sand, obtain a new Mimeo Jewel, without having to fight the NM again, and try to climb again.",
        action = "note",
        entities = { "Mimeo Jewel" },
        zones = {  },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = {  },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 48,
        marker = "*",
        depth = 1,
        instruction = "Do NOT be tempted to use the waypoint or Nexus Cape. It will not count if you use that to get to the top.",
        action = "note",
        entities = { "Nexus Cape" },
        zones = {  },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = {  },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 49,
        marker = "**",
        depth = 2,
        instruction = "After you receive the Mimeo Jewel key item, if you disconnect or log off or zone for any reason (tractor or nexus cape), you will lose the key item and must return to get it again before you climb the mountain.",
        action = "note",
        entities = { "Mimeo Jewel" },
        zones = {  },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = {  },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 50,
        marker = "**",
        depth = 2,
        instruction = "On successive runs (unless there is a new member of your party between then and now who has not yet fought Lioumere), you will not need to fight the NM a second time to get a new Mimeo Jewel.",
        action = "note",
        entities = { "NM", "Mimeo Jewel" },
        zones = {  },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = {  },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 51,
        marker = "*",
        depth = 1,
        instruction = "The starting point for the climb up is located in the northwest corner of (Attohwa Chasm K-9) not far from the Loose Sand. From the Loose Sand, hug the right wall, and keep following it Southwest until you reach an open clearing area where Scorpions spawn. Head towards the center wall of the mountain and follow it South until you see narrow paths on this wall. Look closely at the mountain... Required details: K-9.",
        action = "note",
        entities = {  },
        zones = { "Attohwa Chasm" },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = { "K-9" },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 52,
        marker = "**",
        depth = 2,
        instruction = "Be very careful with your camera control while on the Tor. It's just as easy to fall off the Tor through a misaligned camera especially around corners as losing your way.",
        action = "note",
        entities = {  },
        zones = {  },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = {  },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 53,
        marker = "**",
        depth = 2,
        instruction = "It is advised not to completely trust auto-follow (Command/follow) in this situation, moving along the Tor manually. This way, if one of your leading members makes a mistake and falls off the Tor (which can be more often than one would think), you will maintain your position on the path.",
        action = "note",
        entities = { "Command/follow" },
        zones = {  },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = {  },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 54,
        marker = "*",
        depth = 1,
        instruction = "Along the way you will encounter vents of miasma that block your path, similar to the vents in the area surrounding the Tor itself. Unlike those, however, there are some on the Tor that stop venting for a moment, allowing you (very brief) access.",
        action = "note",
        entities = {  },
        zones = {  },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = {  },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 55,
        marker = "**",
        depth = 2,
        instruction = "To distinguish between a \"permanent\" or \"temporary\" vent, wait about one minute while pushing against the vent; if you do not pass through, the vent is permanent. If you encounter a \"permanent\" vent, it usually indicates that you need to continue by carefully falling off the side of the Tor, landing on a path below. Try to run at an angle with the wall so you keep rubbing against it. This prevents you from...",
