        depth = 2,
        instruction = "If you are planning to use this method, (which seems like the easiest and cheapest) buy or farm 2 per person, since you will be returning to the good old shaft again... (you can optionally farm/purchase 1 additional Snow Lily, as you will need another for Mission 7-3 Fire in the Eyes of Men)",
