      {
        order = 21,
        marker = "**",
        depth = 2,
        instruction = "First take either the Unity Concord warp to Bibiki Bay (level 119), the Survival Guide if you have it, or walk there via Buburimu Peninsula, then buy a multi-ticket from Tswe Panipahr (you'll have to come back again and nothing's as bad as being bounced by accident). Talk with Fheli Lapatzuo and if she... Required details: Unity Concord, Bibiki Bay, Survival Guide, Buburimu Peninsula, Tswe Panipahr, Fheli Lapatzuo.",
