        instruction = "Manaclipper schedule on that dock is Purgonorgo Isle > Maliyakaleya Reef Tour (10m) > Purgonorgo Isle > Dhalmel Rock Tour > repeat. The relevant boarding and departure times are 4:50-5:30 and 16:50-17:30. Consult Manaclipper/Schedule for the full schedule.",
