        marker = "***",
        depth = 3,
        instruction = "If you have the Pungent Providence Pot key item from the Return to the Depths quest (There are 2 other quests before this, which very time consuming if you have not already done them), you can trade him a (cheaper and stackable) bottle of Ahriman Tears instead.",
