      },
      {
        order = 6,
        marker = "*",
        depth = 1,
        instruction = "The first objective is for you to climb a specific tower of The Garden of Ru'Hmet, which are located in the five outlying points of the map. Each tower corresponds to a specific race.",
        action = "note",
        entities = { "The Garden of Ru'Hmet", "race" },
        zones = { "The Garden of Ru'Hmet" },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = {  },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 7,
        marker = "**",
        depth = 2,
        instruction = "Each player may complete this mission by climbing any one of the five towers. However, climbing the tower corresponding to your character's race will grant you a new title, and a key item that will help you in the following mission.",
        action = "note",
        entities = { "Dawn" },
        zones = {  },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = {  },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 8,
        marker = "**",
        depth = 2,
        instruction = "This can be done solo, or with a group, but each player will need to get to the top of the corresponding tower.",
        action = "note",
        entities = {  },
        zones = {  },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = {  },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 9,
        marker = "**",
        depth = 2,
        instruction = "It is much safer (but takes longer) to simply do the race towers for each player (race) as a group. You can go up the teleporters and the floors regardless of race but only the particular race will be able to obtain the key item.",
        action = "note",
        entities = {  },
        zones = {  },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = {  },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 10,
        marker = "**",
        depth = 2,
        instruction = "Although, if all members of the party are good at avoiding aggro, it will be much faster if each member simply do their own part only. Naturally this will be much riskier.",
        action = "note",
        entities = {  },
        zones = {  },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = {  },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 11,
        marker = "**",
        depth = 2,
        instruction = "Definitely the easiest and safest method is to have someone able to sleep everything and anything that attacks on the way. Be aware of light- or dark-based Aw'ghrahs that may resist certain types of sleep.",
        action = "note",
        entities = { "Aw'ghrah" },
        zones = {  },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = {  },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 12,
        marker = "*",
        depth = 1,
        instruction = "A spinning Aw'zdei at the long hallway to each tower spins in the direction of the fastest way to the first elevator.",
        action = "note",
        entities = { "Aw'zdei" },
        zones = {  },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = {  },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 13,
        marker = "*",
        depth = 1,
        instruction = "In each of the larger rooms is an alcove with another Aw'zdei. You can make your way around it twice or sleep it and run to the elevator.",
        action = "travel",
        entities = { "Aw'zdei", "sleep" },
        zones = {  },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = {  },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 14,
        marker = "*",
        depth = 1,
        instruction = "There are two more floors of enemies in the towers. The elevators going up alternate sides. If the first elevator was on the East side, for example, the second will be on the West, and the third on the East again.",
        action = "note",
        entities = {  },
        zones = {  },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = {  },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 15,
        marker = "**",
        depth = 2,
        instruction = "Flee makes this part easier; run about halfway around, then Flee to the elevator so you get there well ahead of any aggression and teleport away.",
        action = "note",
        entities = { "Flee" },
        zones = {  },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = {  },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 16,
        marker = "**",
        depth = 2,
        instruction = "Another technique on the 3rd floor is have a paladin or someone run right through the center, then use Sleepga on them all at the end.",
        action = "note",
        entities = { "Sleepga" },
        zones = {  },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = {  },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 17,
        marker = "*",
        depth = 1,
        instruction = "The fourth floor has no enemies. Run in and check the Ebon Panel in the center of the room twice. Ensure that you have received the key item before leaving this area.",
        action = "examine",
        entities = {  },
        zones = {  },
        map_numbers = {  },
        grid_coordinates = {  },
        items = {  },
        key_items = {  },
        warnings = {  },
      },
      {
        order = 18,
        marker = "**",
        depth = 2,
        instruction = "Any race can check it in any tower to get the first cut-scene, but after that, only characters of the corresponding race in the tower checking it for a 2nd time can get another cut-scene, the Key Item and the title: Warrior of the Crystal",
        action = "note",
